 "remarks": "Exceptional high-end residence offering refined living with gated entry set on desirable Westover Road. Showcasing impeccable craftsmanship and timeless design, this home features 4 spacious bedrooms, each with its own ensuite bathroom. Elegant interiors, a dramatic two story entry, rich hardwood flooring, custom millwork, and extensive use of marble throughout. Wood-burning fireplaces add warmth and character, while the traditional floor plan provides a perfect balance of formal and casual living with formal dining and living rooms, and inviting family room. Sun-filled, walk-out lower level with above-grade exposure ideal for recreation, gym, or additional living space.",
